! mcp_bootstrap_p219.strap -- MCP printed page 219: the V (tape) routines
! V RQ1 .. V WEFT (write end of file), R WTEE, R WTM and V WFEOP.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_001-249.pdf PDF p.226, read at 400 dpi, 900 dpi for
! doubtful glyphs.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP
!  CARD ID CA000271  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 219"; the heading
! row's LOCATION field is 224325, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines, contiguous from 224325.00 to 224366.40.
!   line  42  RLMSGE (IQS*)DD(BU,8), a 45-character message: compiles
!             224352.00 .. 224357.50, prints no binary; line 43 at
!             224360.00 is the next half word.
! p.218 ends at line 50, 224324.40 (V WG LVI, remark -0295, per the
! Vision reading); p.220 (draft) opens at 224367.00.  Contiguous both ways.
!
! >>> THE REMARK COLUMN PRINTS A SEQUENCE NUMBER. <<<  -0296 .. -0327 on
! lines 1-22 and 46-56 (line 19 none; line 20's -0314 prints further
! left, the shape of a second statement on the same card).  Lines 23-45
! carry none.  p.218 line 50 prints -0295, so it runs across the page.
! Written as remarks.
!
! >>> CARD SERIALS. <<<  The header prints CARD ID "CA000271"; the
! right-hand column prints 0A000271 .. 0A000316 (the header's C is the
! open-round 0).  Shared serials: 19/20 (289), 24-27 (293), 28-31
! (294), 33/34 (296), 36/37 (298), 38/39 (299) -- statements several to
! a card.  Asterisks after the LOCATION on lines 13, 35 and 47; a lone
! "." in line 37's NAME field.  Recorded, not explained.
!
! >>> GLYPHS SETTLED OTHER THAN BY PLAIN INK. <<<
!   line 23  ",VP,VPC": D worn to C.  Same binary 225427.02 10 as lines
!            43 and 46, which print VPD / V PD.  Written VPD.
!   line 29  ",DCCMM": DCOMM (landed 35.32 prints 000043.40, as here).
!   line 42  "CC(BU,8)" is DD; the data's 9 leading blanks counted on the
!            ink (character pitch) AND required by line 43's 224360.00
!            (45 chars x 8 = 360 bits, to the next half word).
!   line 35  "CMOCOO" is CM0000 (a CM connective takes four binary digits).
!   lines 24/28  B,DMCP byte prints "C0": 00, as line 19 prints the same
!            statement, and the open round is this row's octal-field 0.
!   lines 1/9  labels V RQ1 / V WQ2 (Vision: RG1/WG2): at 900 dpi the Q
!            is the same tailed glyph as line 4's V RQB.  V WQ2 is checked
!            by line 5's BXVZ (224331.31); V RQ1 rests on ink alone.
!   line 46  V WFEOP, line 48 V WTEOP: the round glyph taken O (EOP);
!            WFEOP is referenced by nothing here -- ink alone.
!   octal-field C glyphs (e.g. "COCOCl.16", "227642.CC") are 0.
!
! External symbols are not yet landed (pp.210-218 and 220 are drafts);
! their values are this page's own binary, and agree with the p.220
! draft where both use them.

